IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sla-ejectment`

-- Service Lands Act 1963, s 2 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_service-lands-act-1963.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a squatter on a Malaysian army camp who appears and is found to be in unlawful occupation` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land in use by the Malaysian army`
    `the informant laying it` IS `the Federal Lands Commissioner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS TRUE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS TRUE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS FALSE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS TRUE

`a squatter on land earmarked for Malaysian forces who stays away after proved service` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land set aside for future use by Malaysian forces`
    `the informant laying it` IS `a person authorised by the Federal Lands Commissioner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS TRUE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS FALSE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS TRUE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS TRUE

`a squatter who neither appears nor is proved to have been served` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land in use by the Malaysian army`
    `the informant laying it` IS `the Federal Lands Commissioner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS TRUE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS FALSE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS FALSE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS TRUE

`an occupier who appears but the Court is not satisfied the information is true` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land in use by the Malaysian army`
    `the informant laying it` IS `a person authorised by the Federal Lands Commissioner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS TRUE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS TRUE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS FALSE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS FALSE

`a squatter on a Singapore Armed Forces camp` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land in use by the Singapore Armed Forces`
    `the informant laying it` IS `the Federal Lands Commissioner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS TRUE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS TRUE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS FALSE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS TRUE

`a private landowner informing against a squatter on a Malaysian army camp` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land in use by the Malaysian army`
    `the informant laying it` IS `a private landowner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS TRUE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS TRUE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS FALSE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS TRUE

`an information that does not allege unlawful occupation` MEANS Proceeding WITH
    `the land occupied` IS `land in use by the Malaysian army`
    `the informant laying it` IS `the Federal Lands Commissioner`
    `the information alleges unlawful occupation` IS FALSE
    `the occupier appeared to the summons` IS TRUE
    `service of the summons is proved` IS FALSE
    `the Court is satisfied the information is true` IS TRUE

§ `s 2(1)`

#ASSERT `section 2 applies to the land` `land in use by the Malaysian army`
#ASSERT `section 2 applies to the land` `land in use by the Malaysian navy`
#ASSERT `section 2 applies to the land` `land in use by the Malaysian air force`
#ASSERT `section 2 applies to the land` `land set aside for future use by Malaysian forces`
#ASSERT NOT `section 2 applies to the land` `land in use by the Singapore Armed Forces`
#ASSERT NOT `section 2 applies to the land` `land in use by another foreign force`
#ASSERT NOT `section 2 applies to the land` `ordinary State land`
#ASSERT NOT `section 2 applies to the land` `private land`

§ `s 2(2)`

#ASSERT `may lay the information` `the Federal Lands Commissioner`
#ASSERT `may lay the information` `a person authorised by the Federal Lands Commissioner`
#ASSERT NOT `may lay the information` `a Singapore government land agency acting on its own account`
#ASSERT NOT `may lay the information` `a police officer acting on his own account`
#ASSERT NOT `may lay the information` `a private landowner`

#ASSERT `the Court may issue a summons` `a squatter on a Malaysian army camp who appears and is found to be in unlawful occupation`
#ASSERT `the Court may issue a summons` `a squatter on land earmarked for Malaysian forces who stays away after proved service`
#ASSERT `the Court may issue a summons` `a squatter who neither appears nor is proved to have been served`
#ASSERT `the Court may issue a summons` `an occupier who appears but the Court is not satisfied the information is true`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may issue a summons` `a squatter on a Singapore Armed Forces camp`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may issue a summons` `a private landowner informing against a squatter on a Malaysian army camp`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may issue a summons` `an information that does not allege unlawful occupation`

#ASSERT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `a squatter on a Malaysian army camp who appears and is found to be in unlawful occupation`
#ASSERT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `a squatter on land earmarked for Malaysian forces who stays away after proved service`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `a squatter who neither appears nor is proved to have been served`
#ASSERT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `an occupier who appears but the Court is not satisfied the information is true`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `a squatter on a Singapore Armed Forces camp`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `a private landowner informing against a squatter on a Malaysian army camp`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may hear and determine the information summarily` `an information that does not allege unlawful occupation`

§ `s 2(3)`

#ASSERT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `a squatter on a Malaysian army camp who appears and is found to be in unlawful occupation`
#ASSERT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `a squatter on land earmarked for Malaysian forces who stays away after proved service`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `a squatter who neither appears nor is proved to have been served`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `an occupier who appears but the Court is not satisfied the information is true`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `a squatter on a Singapore Armed Forces camp`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `a private landowner informing against a squatter on a Malaysian army camp`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must issue a warrant of dispossession` `an information that does not allege unlawful occupation`

#ASSERT `possession is taken of it with the land` `crops growing on the land`
#ASSERT `possession is taken of it with the land` `a building on the land`
#ASSERT `possession is taken of it with the land` `a fixed structure affixed to the land`
#ASSERT NOT `possession is taken of it with the land` `crops already harvested`
#ASSERT NOT `possession is taken of it with the land` `furniture and other movable belongings`
#ASSERT NOT `possession is taken of it with the land` `a vehicle parked on the land`

#ASSERT `may execute the warrant` `a police officer` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `may execute the warrant` `a police officer` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `may execute the warrant` `a police officer` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `may execute the warrant` `an officer of the Federal Lands Commissioner who is not a police officer` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `may execute the warrant` `a court bailiff` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `may execute the warrant` `a member of the armed forces` FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT `possession is taken on behalf of` `the Federal Lands Commissioner`
#ASSERT NOT `possession is taken on behalf of` `the Government of Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `possession is taken on behalf of` `the police`
